that you asked for.

00:00:12.845 --> 00:00:16.015 align:end position:100%
I had a quarter
of these nuts on your chin.

00:00:16.048 --> 00:00:18.618 align:start position:0%
[clears throat]
Right.

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:20.620 align:start position:0%
It's just that
I wanted to review

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:21.854 align:start position:0%
some of these numbers
with you.

00:00:21.887 --> 00:00:24.090 align:start position:0%
It seems like
our earnings are low

00:00:24.123 --> 00:00:25.892 align:start position:0%
against
our original projections.

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:29.195 align:start size:59% position:41%
These nuts were low
against your chin.

00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:38.004 align:start position:0%
You know, Vince,

00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:40.673 align:start position:0%
if you ever need
to talk to me about something,

00:00:40.706 --> 00:00:42.642 align:start position:0%
I'm more than happy
to listen.

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:45.078
These nuts would be more than
happy to rest against your chin.

00:00:47.413 --> 00:00:49.516 align:start position:0%
[sighs]

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:53.686 size:88% position:44%
Hey, look, you've been doing
this for about a week now,

00:00:53.719 --> 00:00:55.955 align:start position:0%
and it was kind of funny
at first.

00:00:55.988 --> 00:00:59.392 align:end position:100%
These nuts were kind of funny
against your chin.

00:00:59.425 --> 00:01:01.127 align:start position:0%
Vince,
I'm worried about you.

00:01:08.834 --> 00:01:11.437 align:end position:100%
I was worried
about these nuts on your chin.

00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:13.739 align:start position:0%
Vince, seriously.

00:01:13.772 --> 00:01:16.042 align:start size:22% position:78%
[sighs]

00:01:16.075 --> 00:01:18.445 size:78% position:61%
[whispering]
These nuts were seriously
on your chin.

00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:23.182
Mr. Graham, I just got a call
from St. Mary's Hospital,

00:01:23.215 --> 00:01:25.885
and your parents
were in a serious car accident.

00:01:25.918 --> 00:01:30.523
I'm so sorry,
but your mother is dead,

00:01:30.556 --> 00:01:33.860
and your father
is on life support.

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:40.600 align:start position:0%
These nuts were supporting
life on your chin.

00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:42.635
Oh, my God.

00:01:42.668 --> 00:01:44.570
- Sorry, Amber.
[door closes]

00:01:44.603 --> 00:01:46.806 align:start size:81% position:19%
Vince, you got to stop it.

00:01:46.839 --> 00:01:49.275 align:end position:100%
Your mother
just passed away.

00:01:49.308 --> 00:01:51.310 align:start position:0%
These nuts
passed away on your chin.

00:01:51.343 --> 00:01:53.513 align:end position:100%
No, they didn't.
They didn't.

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:55.615 align:start size:44% position:56%
Vince, listen,

00:01:55.648 --> 00:01:58.317 align:end position:100%
you got to leave here right now
and go be with your dad.

00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:00.253 align:end position:100%
This could be the last time
that you get to see him.

00:02:00.286 --> 00:02:02.421 align:start position:0%
This could be the last time
I get to see my nuts on your--

00:02:02.454 --> 00:02:03.956 align:start size:66% position:34%
God damn it, Vincent.

00:02:03.989 --> 00:02:06.526 size:84% position:58%
Your father might be dying.

00:02:06.559 --> 00:02:09.229 align:start position:0%
These nuts might be
dying on your chin.

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:11.931 align:start size:59% position:41%
God damn it, Vince!

00:02:11.964 --> 00:02:13.733 align:start size:75% position:25%
Snap the fuck out of it!

00:02:13.766 --> 00:02:15.735 align:start size:63% position:38%
Your mother is dead.

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:23.342 align:start position:0%
Right.
You're right.

00:02:23.375 --> 00:02:24.944
- You okay?
- I'm okay.

00:02:24.977 --> 00:02:26.812 align:start size:53% position:47%
You--you're back.

00:02:26.845 --> 00:02:28.181 align:start position:0%
[whispering]
I don't know what came over me.

00:02:28.214 --> 00:02:30.383
- It's all right.
- It was so good.

00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:32.218 align:start position:0%
It was--it just--

00:02:32.251 --> 00:02:34.587 align:start position:0%
It worked in every situation,
and then it was--

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:36.189 align:start size:47% position:53%
I know. I know.

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:37.657 align:start position:0%
And it was always--
it was just so funny.

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:39.358 align:end position:100%
Well, it wasn't--
it wasn't that funny.

00:02:39.391 --> 00:02:41.327 align:start position:0%
It was funny.

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:43.029 align:end position:100%
It really wasn't
that funny, Vince.

00:02:43.062 --> 00:02:46.432 align:start position:0%
It was...
really funny.

00:02:46.465 --> 00:02:49.635 align:end position:100%
I would not go so far as to
say it was really funny, Vince.

00:02:49.668 --> 00:02:51.437 align:start position:0%
It was funny.

00:02:51.470 --> 00:02:53.706 align:start size:44% position:56%
But it wasn't.

00:02:53.739 --> 00:02:57.143 align:start position:0%
It was.

00:02:57.176 --> 00:02:58.878 align:start size:31% position:69%
It wasn't.

00:02:58.911 --> 00:03:00.213 align:start position:0%
Agree to disagree.

00:03:00.246 --> 00:03:01.514
- It was funny.
- Okay.

00:03:01.547 --> 00:03:02.848
- It was funny.
- One more time.

00:03:02.881 --> 00:03:04.016 size:84% position:58%
I'm just gonna go on record

00:03:04.049 --> 00:03:05.785 align:end position:100%
as saying it wasn't really
that funny.

00:03:07.419 --> 00:03:09.322 size:75% position:38%
I'm gonna go see my dad.

00:03:09.355 --> 00:03:11.157 align:start position:0%
It was funny.

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:12.625 align:start size:66% position:34%
It wasn't that funny.

00:03:12.658 --> 00:03:15.628
[sweeping orchestration]

00:03:15.661 --> 00:03:23.670
♪ ♪

00:03:30.509 --> 00:03:32.578 align:start position:0%
Dad.
[breathing heavily]

00:03:32.611 --> 00:03:35.281 align:start position:0%
Stay with me.

00:03:35.314 --> 00:03:38.618 align:start position:0%
Dad, I love you.

00:03:38.651 --> 00:03:40.586
[monitor beeping]

00:03:40.619 --> 00:03:43.156 align:start size:41% position:59%
And I love...

00:03:45.357 --> 00:03:48.561 align:end position:100%
These nuts
on your chin.

00:03:50.896 --> 00:03:55.301
[flatline]

00:04:00.172 --> 00:04:04.077
